</dl></section><section id="notes1"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Author contributions</h2>
<p>Conceptualization, LB, AN, PF, and FB; methodology, LB, AN, PF and FB; validation, FB; formal analysis, PF and FB; data curation, PF; writing—original draft preparation, LB, AN, PF, EM, and FB; writing—review and editing, all authors; supervision, FB. All authors read and approved the final manuscript.</p></section><section id="notes2"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Funding</h2>
<p>Our work was supported by Institut Paoli-Calmettes, la Ligue Nationale Contre le Cancer (Label Ligue EL2022: FB), and Le Prix Ruban Rose 2020 (FB). JYB is supported by NetSARC (INCA), LYRICAN (INCA-DGOS-INSERM 12563), InterSARC (INCA), LabEx DEvweCAN (ANR-10-LABX-0061), and EURACAN (EC 739521).</p></section><section id="notes3"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Availability of data and materials</h2>
<p>All data generated or analysed during this study are included in this published article [and its supplementary information file: Additional file <a href="#MOESM13" class="usa-link">13</a>: Table S8.</p></section><section id="notes4"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Declarations</h2>
<section id="FPar1"><h3 class="pmc_sec_title">Ethics approval and consent to participate</h3>
<p id="Par45">Our <em>in silico</em> study is based upon public data from published studies in which the informed patient's consent to participate and the ethics and institutional review board were already obtained by authors. The study was approved by our institutional review board.</p></section><section id="FPar2"><h3 class="pmc_sec_title">Consent for publication</h3>
<p id="Par46">Not applicable.</p></section><section id="FPar3"><h3 class="pmc_sec_title">Competing interests</h3>
<p id="Par47">ALC received consulting fees from Pharmamar, Bayer, and Deciphera. The other authors have declared no conflict of interest.</p></section></section><section id="fn-group1" class="fn-group"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Footnotes</h2>
